Acceptance criteria
-------------------
Front bezel has grayscale text only, not a purple orbital sticker.
Top maker mark has real raised geometry and an original non-Nintendo treatment.
Notifications align below the header logo without blocking scene input.
Named icons have distinct shapes and retain usable 44px targets at phone sizes.
LCD-only fullscreen shows actual running frames, accepts existing controls and
returns without a new runtime, reset, checkpoint restore or changed power intent.
Startup uses a 960x640 raster with unchanged 3:2 logical composition, contained
orbit and gentle wordmark wave; reduced motion is static and timing is retained.

